      <title>韩国券商警告：三星电子和SK海力士内存库存降至不足10天供应量</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260907/%E9%9F%A9%E5%9B%BD%E5%88%B8%E5%95%86%E8%AD%A6%E5%91%8A%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E5%92%8CSK%E6%B5%B7%E5%8A%9B%E5%A3%AB%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E5%BA%93%E5%AD%98%E9%99%8D%E8%87%B3%E4%B8%8D%E8%B6%B310%E5%A4%A9%E4%BE%9B%E5%BA%94%E9%87%8F/</link>
